	<h1 class="heading1">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h1>
	<p style="font-size: 1.2vw">Do you have questions? These are quick answers to some questions you may have.<br>If you can't find an answer to your question here, then you can chat with our friendly team!</p>
	<div class="questionsBox">
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>WHAT IS myOrganizer?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>myOrganizer is an application that helps you to create your personalised and desired list with ease, and can as well save the list to your device in pdf format.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>WHY IS IT NAMED myOrganizer?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>The app was named myOrganizer because the purpose of the application is order. Most times, people go to the market and could forget to get one or two things, or youc could have tasks to perform and could skip one cause it's always very possible to forget things, so myOrganizer was designed to help people to be more organised and avoid forget things and meeting all that is to be met.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>IS myOrganizer FREE?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>The myOrganizer web application is completely free. The mobile application is also free, but can be upgraded to premium to access our premium features for myOrganizer<p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>HOW DO I CHANGE MY ACCOUNT E-MAIL?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>To ensure our customers' privacy, you cannot change your e-mail address once you have signed up. If you want to sign up to myOrganizer with a new e-mail address, you will have to create a new account with us, and you can then request for your old account to be deleted, note that you will have to change your username as you cannot sign up with an existing username. If you are using our mobile application, then, in creating your account, link to the old one, and then you can delete the old one and your data will be on your new account. This is a measure we have taken to ensure our customers privacy and security.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>IS MY E-MAIL SECURE ON THIS PLATFORM?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>Yes, our customers' e-mail are very secure in our databases. We do not use any of our customers' details for any use that goes against our policy.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>HOW DO I CREATE A LIST?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>To create a list, there is a menu by the left of our page, select the option 'Create list'.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>WHAT OTHER APPS DO YOU HAVE?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>We have a lot of interesting apps ranging from the very popular Laugh, to other well used apps like GistMe, myWorship, Friends, Learn, Communicate, and so many others.<br>Check us out @ www.AlwaysAhead/Apps.com</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>DO YOU HAVE A MOBILE APP FOR THIS?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>Yes! myOrganizer has a mobile application, it is available on both the App Store and Google Play Store.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>DO YOU HAVE A MOBILE APP FOR APPLE DEVICES?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>Yes! We have myOrganizer Mobile App for any version of your apple device, it is available on the App Store.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>HOW CAN I CHANGE MY USERNAME?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>You cannot change your username. Once you have created a username, you cannot change it. You can always create a new account with your same e-mail, this can as well be linked to the old one using your e-mail. Find out more on our page.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>HOW CAN I CHECK MY OTHER LISTS?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>On your mobile app, there is an option on the menu by the left of the page, that says 'View my lists', click on it and your saved lists will be displayed. You can click on the list you want to check to open it.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>HOW  DO I LOG OUT?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>On the menu by the left of the page, there is a an option by the bottom that reads 'Log out', click on it, and you'll be logged out.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)">
			<h1>HOW CAN I CHANGE THE THEME OF THE APP?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>On the mobile app, open the left menu, and click on Settings, then in setting go to Themes, you can choose any of the custom themes or choose to customise your own app theme.</p>
		</a></div>
		<div class="QBox"><a onclick="openn(this)" id="gg">
			<h1>WHO BUILT myOrganizer?<img class="down" src="/images/myOrganizer/icons8-down-25.png"></h1>
			<p>myOrganizer is an application built by one of our teams at AlwaysAhead.</p>
		</a></div>
	</div>
